<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Hexagon debut at 11.40 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Hexagon debut at 11.40 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of engineering firm Hexagon Holdings Bhd made their debut at 11.40 ringgit against an offer price of 3.00.</p>
<p>The company offered 3.02 million shares for its listing on the Second Board of the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.  </p>
<p>Around 10 minutes into the opening, the stock was at 11.70 ringgit on volume of 1.56 million shares traded.</p>
<p>Hexagon forecast net earnings per share of 63.22 cents for the year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>At 11.40 ringgit, price to earnings ratio is 18 times.</p>
</text>
